{"t":"say","text":"Prompt chain pattern: vision extraction, hint generation with a guard against answers, and teacher escalation via approval."}
{"t":"assume","id":"chat-channel","text":"Students submit photos via WhatsApp or web chat"}
{"t":"assume","id":"daily-volume","text":"Under 1000 worksheet submissions per day"}
{"t":"step","id":"in","kind":"trigger","label":"Receive worksheet photo","runs":"fc","untrusted":true,"private":true,"why":"Entry point for student image upload"}
{"t":"step","id":"guard-in","kind":"guard","label":"Screen inbound content","product":"ai-guardrails","runs":"fc","why":"Block harmful or off-topic uploads before processing"}
{"t":"step","id":"ocr","kind":"ai","label":"Read worksheet image","task":"see","ai":"qwen3.7-plus","runs":"fc","why":"Extract text and math from the student photo"}
{"t":"step","id":"tutor","kind":"ai","label":"Generate learning hint","task":"generate","ai":"qwen3.8-max","runs":"fc","why":"Produce a pedagogical hint without revealing the answer"}
{"t":"step","id":"guard-hint","kind":"guard","label":"Ensure no full answer","product":"ai-guardrails","runs":"fc","why":"Verify the hint does not contain the direct solution"}
{"t":"step","id":"reply","kind":"act","label":"Send hint to student","effect":"reply","runs":"fc","why":"Deliver the safe hint back to the student"}
{"t":"step","id":"flag-review","kind":"human","label":"Flag for teacher review","task":"review","subject":"tutor","runs":"cloudflow","approval":"required","why":"Teacher reviews flagged interactions asynchronously"}
{"t":"step","id":"end-ok","kind":"end","label":"Hint delivered","runs":"customer","why":"Successful completion path"}
{"t":"step","id":"end-flagged","kind":"end","label":"Teacher notified","runs":"customer","why":"Completion path after teacher review"}
{"t":"link","id":"l-in-guard","from":"in","to":"guard-in"}
{"t":"link","id":"l-guard-ocr","from":"guard-in","to":"ocr"}
{"t":"link","id":"l-ocr-tutor","from":"ocr","to":"tutor"}
{"t":"link","id":"l-tutor-guard","from":"tutor","to":"guard-hint"}
{"t":"link","id":"l-guard-reply","from":"guard-hint","to":"reply"}
{"t":"link","id":"l-reply-end","from":"reply","to":"end-ok"}
{"t":"link","id":"l-reply-flag","from":"reply","to":"flag-review","kind":"next","label":"Always flag for async review"}
{"t":"link","id":"l-flag-end","from":"flag-review","to":"end-flagged","kind":"branch","outcome":"approve"}
{"t":"ask","id":"q-channel","text":"Which channel will students use to submit photos (WhatsApp, DingTalk, or web app)?"}
{"t":"ask","id":"q-success","text":"What defines a successful hint, and what is the current baseline for teacher interventions?"}
{"t":"done","summary":"AI tutor prompt chain that extracts worksheet text via vision, generates hints guarded against full answers, replies to the student, and flags teachers for review."}

{"t":"say","text":"Single agent pattern: PR review with sandbox test verification, noise filtering, and human approval gate."}
{"t":"assume","id":"vcs-assume","text":"GitHub webhook triggers EventBridge on PR events","alt":"GitLab or other VCS via custom FC webhook"}
{"t":"assume","id":"sandbox-assume","text":"Agent Sandbox runs isolated tests per PR","alt":"ACS Agent Sandbox pods for heavier workloads"}
{"t":"assume","id":"repo-assume","text":"Repository URL and credentials are configured","alt":"Customer adapter fetches repo metadata"}
{"t":"req","text":"Human must approve before PR is merged"}
{"t":"step","id":"pr-trigger","kind":"trigger","label":"PR webhook","product":"eventbridge","runs":"fc","untrusted":true,"why":"Entry point for pull request events from the VCS"}
{"t":"step","id":"guard-input","kind":"guard","label":"Screen PR payload","product":"ai-guardrails","runs":"fc","why":"Block prompt injection in PR titles, bodies or diffs"}
{"t":"step","id":"review-agent","kind":"agent","label":"Review PR code","task":"review","ai":"qwen3.8-max","tool":"code_interpreter","turns":10,"runs":"agentrun","untrusted":true,"private":true,"why":"Analyse diff, generate comments, run tests to verify findings"}
{"t":"step","id":"filter-noise","kind":"ai","label":"Filter noisy comments","task":"check","ai":"qwen3.8-flash","runs":"fc","why":"Remove trivial or low-confidence suggestions before posting"}
{"t":"step","id":"post-comments","kind":"act","label":"Post review comments","effect":"write","runs":"customer","approval":"skip","why":"Publish filtered comments back to the VCS pull request"}
{"t":"step","id":"human-approve","kind":"human","label":"Human reviewer approval","task":"approve","subject":"filter-noise","runs":"cloudflow","why":"Final human gate before merge is allowed"}
{"t":"step","id":"merge-pr","kind":"act","label":"Merge pull request","effect":"admin","runs":"customer","approval":"required","why":"Apply the approved merge after human sign-off"}
{"t":"step","id":"end-merged","kind":"end","label":"PR merged","runs":"customer"}
{"t":"step","id":"end-rejected","kind":"end","label":"PR rejected by human","runs":"customer"}
{"t":"link","id":"trig-guard","from":"pr-trigger","to":"guard-input"}
{"t":"link","id":"guard-agent","from":"guard-input","to":"review-agent"}
{"t":"link","id":"agent-filter","from":"review-agent","to":"filter-noise"}
{"t":"link","id":"filter-post","from":"filter-noise","to":"post-comments"}
{"t":"link","id":"post-human","from":"post-comments","to":"human-approve"}
{"t":"link","id":"human-merge","from":"human-approve","to":"merge-pr","kind":"branch","outcome":"approve"}
{"t":"link","id":"human-reject","from":"human-approve","to":"end-rejected","kind":"branch","outcome":"reject"}
{"t":"link","id":"human-edit","from":"human-approve","to":"filter-noise","kind":"branch","outcome":"edit"}
{"t":"link","id":"merge-end","from":"merge-pr","to":"end-merged"}
{"t":"ask","id":"vol-q","text":"How many pull requests open per day?"}
{"t":"ask","id":"success-q","text":"What review quality metric defines success today?"}
{"t":"done","summary":"Coding agent reviews PRs, verifies via sandbox, filters noise, posts comments, then gates merge on human approval."}

{"t":"say","text":"Prompt chain pattern: extract clauses, retrieve playbook rules, compare and draft redlines, then lawyer approval before delivery."}
{"t":"assume","id":"input-assume","text":"Contracts arrive as PDF uploads via webhook or chat app"}
{"t":"assume","id":"playbook-assume","text":"Legal playbook is stored in a vector database for retrieval"}
{"t":"ask","id":"volume","text":"How many contracts do you process per day?"}
{"t":"ask","id":"success","text":"What outcome defines success, and what is today's baseline review time?"}
{"t":"step","id":"upload","kind":"trigger","label":"Contract upload","runs":"fc","untrusted":true,"why":"Entry point for uploaded contract files"}
{"t":"step","id":"guard-in","kind":"guard","label":"Screen upload safety","product":"ai-guardrails","runs":"fc","why":"Block prompt injection or harmful payloads in uploads"}
{"t":"step","id":"parse-pdf","kind":"tool","label":"Parse contract PDF","task":"extract","tool":"pdf_parse","runs":"fc","effect":"read","untrusted":true,"why":"Extract raw text from the uploaded PDF contract"}
{"t":"step","id":"extract-clauses","kind":"ai","label":"Extract contract clauses","task":"extract","ai":"qwen3.7-plus","runs":"fc","after":"parse-pdf","why":"Identify and structure individual legal clauses from text"}
{"t":"step","id":"embed-clauses","kind":"knowledge","label":"Embed extracted clauses","task":"retrieve","product":"dashvector","ai":"text-embedding-v4","runs":"fc","after":"extract-clauses","why":"Vectorize clauses to enable semantic playbook matching"}
{"t":"step","id":"retrieve-playbook","kind":"knowledge","label":"Retrieve playbook rules","task":"retrieve","product":"dashvector","runs":"fc","after":"embed-clauses","why":"Fetch relevant legal playbook standards for comparison"}
{"t":"step","id":"rank-rules","kind":"knowledge","label":"Rank playbook matches","task":"rerank","ai":"qwen3-rerank","runs":"fc","after":"retrieve-playbook","why":"Order retrieved rules by relevance to each clause"}
{"t":"step","id":"compare-draft","kind":"ai","label":"Compare and draft redlines","task":"generate","ai":"qwen3.8-max","runs":"fc","after":"rank-rules","private":true,"why":"Analyze gaps between clauses and playbook, draft redline text"}
{"t":"step","id":"guard-out","kind":"guard","label":"Screen drafted redlines","product":"ai-guardrails","runs":"fc","after":"compare-draft","private":true,"why":"Ensure generated redlines contain no data leaks or errors"}
{"t":"step","id":"lawyer-review","kind":"human","label":"Lawyer approves redlines","task":"approve","subject":"compare-draft","runs":"cloudflow","after":"guard-out","approval":"required","why":"Human lawyer must approve consequential legal redlines"}
{"t":"step","id":"deliver","kind":"act","label":"Deliver approved redlines","effect":"send","runs":"fc","after":"lawyer-review","approval":"skip","why":"Send final approved redlines back to the requester"}
{"t":"step","id":"done-ok","kind":"end","label":"Redlines delivered","runs":"customer","after":"deliver","why":"Successful completion path"}
{"t":"step","id":"done-reject","kind":"end","label":"Redlines rejected","runs":"customer","why":"Termination path when lawyer rejects the draft"}
{"t":"link","id":"l-upload-guard","from":"upload","to":"guard-in","kind":"next","label":"file received"}
{"t":"link","id":"l-guard-parse","from":"guard-in","to":"parse-pdf","kind":"next","label":"safe"}
{"t":"link","id":"l-parse-extract","from":"parse-pdf","to":"extract-clauses","kind":"next","label":"text ready"}
{"t":"link","id":"l-extract-embed","from":"extract-clauses","to":"embed-clauses","kind":"next","label":"clauses parsed"}
{"t":"link","id":"l-embed-retrieve","from":"embed-clauses","to":"retrieve-playbook","kind":"next","label":"vectors ready"}
{"t":"link","id":"l-retrieve-rank","from":"retrieve-playbook","to":"rank-rules","kind":"next","label":"results fetched"}
{"t":"link","id":"l-rank-compare","from":"rank-rules","to":"compare-draft","kind":"next","label":"rules ranked"}
{"t":"link","id":"l-compare-guard","from":"compare-draft","to":"guard-out","kind":"next","label":"draft ready"}
{"t":"link","id":"l-guard-review","from":"guard-out","to":"lawyer-review","kind":"next","label":"screened"}
{"t":"link","id":"l-approve-deliver","from":"lawyer-review","to":"deliver","kind":"branch","outcome":"approve","label":"approved"}
{"t":"link","id":"l-approve-edit","from":"lawyer-review","to":"compare-draft","kind":"branch","outcome":"edit","label":"needs revision"}
{"t":"link","id":"l-reject-end","from":"lawyer-review","to":"done-reject","kind":"branch","outcome":"reject","label":"rejected"}
{"t":"link","id":"l-deliver-done","from":"deliver","to":"done-ok","kind":"next","label":"sent"}
{"t":"done","summary":"Prompt chain extracting PDF clauses, retrieving playbook rules via DashVector, drafting redlines with qwen3.8-max, guarded output, and lawyer approval gate."}

{"t":"say","text":"Prompt chain with parallel vision and PDF extraction, policy check, payout approval gate, then agent for unknown-length lookups."}
{"t":"assume","id":"policy-store","text":"Policies stored in a customer database or API"}
{"t":"assume","id":"claim-volume","text":"Moderate daily claim volume under 100 runs"}
{"t":"ask","id":"volume","text":"How many claims are submitted per day?"}
{"t":"ask","id":"success","text":"What outcome defines success, and what is today's baseline?"}
{"t":"step","id":"upload","kind":"trigger","label":"Receive claim files","runs":"fc","untrusted":true,"private":true,"why":"Entry point for uploaded claim photos and PDFs"}
{"t":"step","id":"guard","kind":"guard","label":"Screen uploads","product":"ai-guardrails","runs":"fc","why":"Block prompt injection and harmful content in uploads"}
{"t":"step","id":"fan-out","kind":"decide","label":"Route by file type","task":"classify","ai":"qwen3.8-flash","runs":"fc","why":"Send images to vision and PDFs to text extraction"}
{"t":"step","id":"see-photo","kind":"ai","label":"Extract photo data","task":"extract","ai":"qwen3.7-plus","runs":"fc","private":true,"why":"Vision model extracts claim details from photos"}
{"t":"step","id":"parse-pdf","kind":"tool","label":"Parse PDF text","task":"extract","tool":"pdf_parse","runs":"fc","effect":"read","private":true,"why":"Built-in tool extracts text from PDF claims"}
{"t":"step","id":"extract-pdf","kind":"ai","label":"Extract PDF fields","task":"extract","ai":"qwen3.8-flash","runs":"fc","private":true,"after":"parse-pdf","why":"Structure raw PDF text into claim fields"}
{"t":"step","id":"merge","kind":"ai","label":"Merge extracted data","task":"summarise","ai":"qwen3.8-flash","runs":"fc","join":"any","private":true,"why":"Unify outputs from parallel extraction branches"}
{"t":"step","id":"check-policy","kind":"agent","label":"Verify policy coverage","task":"check","ai":"qwen3.7-plus","runs":"agentrun","turns":5,"private":true,"why":"Agent looks up policy rules to validate the claim"}
{"t":"step","id":"assess","kind":"ai","label":"Assess payout eligibility","task":"check","ai":"qwen3.8-max","runs":"fc","private":true,"why":"Large model reasons about payout eligibility"}
{"t":"step","id":"approve-payout","kind":"human","label":"Approve payout","task":"approve","subject":"assess","runs":"cloudflow","approval":"required","why":"Human must approve any financial payout decision"}
{"t":"step","id":"pay","kind":"act","label":"Process payout","effect":"pay","runs":"customer","approval":"required","why":"Execute the approved payout in the payment system"}
{"t":"step","id":"paid","kind":"end","label":"Payout completed","runs":"customer","why":"Successful end state"}
{"t":"step","id":"denied","kind":"end","label":"Claim denied","runs":"customer","why":"End state when payout is rejected"}
{"t":"step","id":"escalate","kind":"human","label":"Manual review","task":"takeover","runs":"cloudflow","why":"Escalate uncertain claims to a human adjuster"}
{"t":"link","id":"l-upload-guard","from":"upload","to":"guard","kind":"next"}
{"t":"link","id":"l-guard-fan","from":"guard","to":"fan-out","kind":"next"}
{"t":"link","id":"l-fan-photo","from":"fan-out","to":"see-photo","kind":"branch","label":"image file"}
{"t":"link","id":"l-fan-pdf","from":"fan-out","to":"parse-pdf","kind":"branch","label":"pdf file"}
{"t":"link","id":"l-parse-extract","from":"parse-pdf","to":"extract-pdf","kind":"next"}
{"t":"link","id":"l-photo-merge","from":"see-photo","to":"merge","kind":"next"}
{"t":"link","id":"l-extract-merge","from":"extract-pdf","to":"merge","kind":"next"}
{"t":"link","id":"l-merge-policy","from":"merge","to":"check-policy","kind":"next"}
{"t":"link","id":"l-policy-assess","from":"check-policy","to":"assess","kind":"next"}
{"t":"link","id":"l-assess-approve","from":"assess","to":"approve-payout","kind":"next"}
{"t":"link","id":"l-approve-pay","from":"approve-payout","to":"pay","kind":"branch","outcome":"approve"}
{"t":"link","id":"l-approve-deny","from":"approve-payout","to":"denied","kind":"branch","outcome":"reject"}
{"t":"link","id":"l-approve-edit","from":"approve-payout","to":"assess","kind":"branch","outcome":"edit"}
{"t":"link","id":"l-pay-paid","from":"pay","to":"paid","kind":"next"}
{"t":"link","id":"l-assess-esc","from":"assess","to":"escalate","kind":"escalate","label":"uncertain eligibility"}
{"t":"done","summary":"Designed a claim-processing workflow: guarded upload ingestion, parallel photo/PDF extraction, policy-checking agent, LLM assessment, mandatory human payout approval, and escalation."}

{"t":"say","text":"Prompt chain with parallel fan-out for multilingual SEO generation, human approval gate, then marketplace publish."}
{"t":"assume","id":"img-src","text":"Supplier photos arrive via OSS upload or webhook trigger"}
{"t":"assume","id":"langs","text":"Target languages: English, Chinese, Thai, Bahasa"}
{"t":"assume","id":"queue","text":"Merchandiser queue uses AgentCore governed workflow"}
{"t":"ask","id":"volume","text":"How many supplier photos do you process per day?"}
{"t":"ask","id":"success","text":"What listing quality metric defines success today?"}
{"t":"each","id":"lang-loop","over":"target locales (en, zh, th, id)","parallel":true}
{"t":"step","id":"in","kind":"trigger","label":"Receive supplier photo","product":"eventbridge","runs":"fc","untrusted":true,"effect":"read"}
{"t":"step","id":"guard","kind":"guard","label":"Screen image safety","product":"ai-guardrails","runs":"fc"}
{"t":"step","id":"extract","kind":"ai","label":"Extract product attributes","task":"extract","ai":"qwen3.7-plus","runs":"fc"}
{"t":"step","id":"seo-en","kind":"ai","label":"Generate English SEO listing","task":"generate","ai":"qwen3.7-plus","runs":"fc","repeat":"lang-loop"}
{"t":"step","id":"approve","kind":"human","label":"Merchandiser review","task":"approve","subject":"seo-en","runs":"cloudflow","join":"all"}
{"t":"step","id":"pub-amazon","kind":"act","label":"Publish to Amazon","effect":"publish","product":"third-party-api","runs":"fc","approval":"required"}
{"t":"step","id":"pub-shopee","kind":"act","label":"Publish to Shopee","effect":"publish","product":"third-party-api","runs":"fc","approval":"required"}
{"t":"step","id":"done-pub","kind":"end","label":"Listings published","runs":"customer"}
{"t":"step","id":"rejected","kind":"end","label":"Listing rejected","runs":"customer"}
{"t":"link","id":"l-in-guard","from":"in","to":"guard"}
{"t":"link","id":"l-guard-extract","from":"guard","to":"extract"}
{"t":"link","id":"l-extract-seo","from":"extract","to":"seo-en"}
{"t":"link","id":"l-seo-approve","from":"seo-en","to":"approve"}
{"t":"link","id":"l-approve-amz","from":"approve","to":"pub-amazon","kind":"branch","outcome":"approve"}
{"t":"link","id":"l-approve-shp","from":"approve","to":"pub-shopee","kind":"branch","outcome":"approve"}
{"t":"link","id":"l-reject","from":"approve","to":"rejected","kind":"branch","outcome":"reject"}
{"t":"link","id":"l-edit","from":"approve","to":"seo-en","kind":"branch","outcome":"edit"}
{"t":"link","id":"l-amz-done","from":"pub-amazon","to":"done-pub"}
{"t":"link","id":"l-shp-done","from":"pub-shopee","to":"done-pub"}
{"t":"done","summary":"Multilingual product-listing pipeline with vision extraction, parallel SEO generation, merchandiser approval gate, and dual marketplace publishing."}

{"t":"say","text":"Single agent pattern: polls flight status, detects disruptions, searches rebooking options, and proposes for human approval before acting."}
{"t":"assume","id":"flight-api","text":"Flight status and rebooking via third-party API or customer system","alt":"Direct GDS integration by customer adapter"}
{"t":"ask","id":"volume","text":"How many flights or passengers should be monitored per day?"}
{"t":"ask","id":"success","text":"What defines a successful rebooking proposal, and what is today's baseline resolution time?"}
{"t":"step","id":"poll-trigger","kind":"trigger","label":"Scheduled flight poll","product":"schedulerx","runs":"fc","why":"Periodically check flight statuses for disruptions"}
{"t":"step","id":"monitor-agent","kind":"agent","label":"Flight disruption agent","task":"plan","ai":"qwen3.8-max","runs":"agentrun","turns":10,"effect":"read","untrusted":true,"why":"Orchestrates status checks, disruption detection, option search and proposal drafting"}
{"t":"step","id":"check-status","kind":"tool","label":"Check flight status","task":"extract","tool":"mcp","runs":"agentrun","effect":"read","on":"monitor-agent","untrusted":true,"why":"Fetch current flight status from airline or aggregator API"}
{"t":"step","id":"search-rebook","kind":"tool","label":"Search rebooking options","task":"retrieve","tool":"mcp","runs":"agentrun","effect":"read","on":"monitor-agent","why":"Find alternative flights when disruption is detected"}
{"t":"step","id":"draft-proposal","kind":"ai","label":"Draft rebooking proposal","task":"generate","ai":"qwen3.7-plus","runs":"agentrun","on":"monitor-agent","why":"Summarize disruption and present ranked rebooking options clearly"}
{"t":"step","id":"guard-output","kind":"guard","label":"Screen proposal content","product":"ai-guardrails","runs":"fc","after":"monitor-agent","why":"Ensure no private data leaks or harmful content before human review"}
{"t":"step","id":"human-approve","kind":"human","label":"Approve rebooking","task":"approve","subject":"draft-proposal","runs":"cloudflow","approval":"required","after":"guard-output","why":"Human must approve consequential rebooking action per shared policy"}
{"t":"step","id":"execute-rebook","kind":"act","label":"Execute rebooking","effect":"write","runs":"customer","approval":"required","after":"human-approve","why":"Apply approved rebooking to the airline or booking system"}
{"t":"step","id":"notify-passenger","kind":"act","label":"Notify passenger","effect":"notify","runs":"fc","after":"execute-rebook","why":"Inform passenger of confirmed rebooking details"}
{"t":"step","id":"end-booked","kind":"end","label":"Rebooking completed","runs":"customer"}
{"t":"step","id":"end-declined","kind":"end","label":"Rebooking declined","runs":"customer"}
{"t":"step","id":"end-no-issue","kind":"end","label":"No disruption found","runs":"customer"}
{"t":"link","id":"poll-to-agent","from":"poll-trigger","to":"monitor-agent"}
{"t":"link","id":"agent-to-guard","from":"monitor-agent","to":"guard-output"}
{"t":"link","id":"guard-to-approve","from":"guard-output","to":"human-approve"}
{"t":"link","id":"approve-execute","from":"human-approve","to":"execute-rebook","kind":"branch","outcome":"approve"}
{"t":"link","id":"approve-declined","from":"human-approve","to":"end-declined","kind":"branch","outcome":"reject"}
{"t":"link","id":"approve-edit","from":"human-approve","to":"monitor-agent","kind":"branch","outcome":"edit","max":3}
{"t":"link","id":"execute-notify","from":"execute-rebook","to":"notify-passenger"}
{"t":"link","id":"notify-end","from":"notify-passenger","to":"end-booked"}
{"t":"done","summary":"Polling agent monitors flights, drafts rebooking proposals on disruption, gates through guard and human approval, then executes and notifies."}

{"t":"say","text":"Prompt chain with parallel document parsing, regulatory retrieval, risk flagging, and human approval before submission."}
{"t":"assume","id":"dest-country","text":"Destination country is extracted from the uploaded documents.","alt":"Destination country is provided as workflow input metadata."}
{"t":"assume","id":"reg-source","text":"Regulations are stored in a managed vector database for RAG.","alt":"Regulations are fetched via an external compliance API."}
{"t":"ask","id":"volume","text":"How many customs document sets are processed per day?"}
{"t":"ask","id":"success","text":"What outcome defines success, and what is today's baseline approval rate?"}
{"t":"step","id":"upload","kind":"trigger","label":"Receive documents","task":"extract","runs":"fc","untrusted":true,"private":true,"why":"Entry point for uploaded customs invoices and packing lists."}
{"t":"step","id":"screen","kind":"guard","label":"Screen uploads","product":"ai-guardrails","runs":"fc","why":"Detect malicious payloads or prompt injection in uploaded files."}
{"t":"step","id":"parse-invoice","kind":"tool","label":"Parse invoice","task":"extract","tool":"pdf_parse","runs":"fc","effect":"read","private":true,"why":"Extract structured text from the customs invoice PDF."}
{"t":"step","id":"parse-packing","kind":"tool","label":"Parse packing list","task":"extract","tool":"pdf_parse","runs":"fc","effect":"read","private":true,"why":"Extract structured text from the packing list PDF."}
{"t":"step","id":"merge-data","kind":"ai","label":"Merge parsed data","task":"extract","ai":"qwen3.8-flash","runs":"fc","why":"Combine invoice and packing list fields into one JSON payload."}
{"t":"step","id":"get-dest","kind":"ai","label":"Identify destination","task":"extract","ai":"qwen3.8-flash","runs":"fc","why":"Determine the destination country to scope regulatory checks."}
{"t":"step","id":"retrieve-reg","kind":"knowledge","label":"Fetch regulations","task":"retrieve","product":"dashvector","ai":"text-embedding-v4","runs":"fc","why":"Retrieve destination-specific customs rules from vector store."}
{"t":"step","id":"rank-reg","kind":"knowledge","label":"Rank regulations","task":"rerank","ai":"qwen3-rerank","runs":"fc","why":"Rerank retrieved regulations by relevance to the shipment data."}
{"t":"step","id":"check-comply","kind":"ai","label":"Check compliance","task":"check","ai":"qwen3.7-plus","runs":"fc","why":"Compare shipment details against ranked regulatory requirements."}
{"t":"step","id":"flag-risk","kind":"ai","label":"Flag risks","task":"classify","ai":"qwen3.7-plus","runs":"fc","why":"Classify and summarize any compliance gaps or risk factors."}
{"t":"step","id":"draft-report","kind":"ai","label":"Draft report","task":"generate","ai":"qwen3.7-plus","runs":"fc","why":"Generate a compliance summary report for the officer to review."}
{"t":"step","id":"approve","kind":"human","label":"Officer approval","task":"approve","subject":"draft-report","runs":"cloudflow","approval":"required","why":"Compliance officer must approve or reject before submission."}
{"t":"step","id":"submit","kind":"act","label":"Submit declaration","effect":"send","runs":"customer","approval":"required","why":"Send approved documents to the destination customs system."}
{"t":"step","id":"end-ok","kind":"end","label":"Submitted","runs":"customer","why":"Terminal state for successful submission."}
{"t":"step","id":"end-reject","kind":"end","label":"Rejected","runs":"customer","why":"Terminal state when officer rejects the submission."}
{"t":"link","id":"l-screen","from":"upload","to":"screen"}
{"t":"link","id":"l-inv","from":"screen","to":"parse-invoice"}
{"t":"link","id":"l-pack","from":"screen","to":"parse-packing"}
{"t":"link","id":"l-merge","from":"parse-invoice","to":"merge-data","join":"all"}
{"t":"link","id":"l-pack-m","from":"parse-packing","to":"merge-data"}
{"t":"link","id":"l-dest","from":"merge-data","to":"get-dest"}
{"t":"link","id":"l-ret","from":"get-dest","to":"retrieve-reg"}
{"t":"link","id":"l-rank","from":"retrieve-reg","to":"rank-reg"}
{"t":"link","id":"l-chk","from":"rank-reg","to":"check-comply"}
{"t":"link","id":"l-flag","from":"check-comply","to":"flag-risk"}
{"t":"link","id":"l-draft","from":"flag-risk","to":"draft-report"}
{"t":"link","id":"l-appr","from":"draft-report","to":"approve"}
{"t":"link","id":"l-sub","from":"approve","to":"submit","kind":"branch","outcome":"approve"}
{"t":"link","id":"l-edit","from":"approve","to":"draft-report","kind":"branch","outcome":"edit"}
{"t":"link","id":"l-rej","from":"approve","to":"end-reject","kind":"branch","outcome":"reject"}
{"t":"link","id":"l-end","from":"submit","to":"end-ok"}
{"t":"done","summary":"Created a customs compliance workflow with parallel parsing, regulatory RAG, risk flagging, draft reporting, and human approval gating submission."}

{"t":"say","text":"Prompt chain with guarded chat, catalog retrieval, coupon validation and checkout approval before applying discounts."}
{"t":"assume","id":"chat-channel","text":"Web chat via custom webhook into Function Compute"}
