{"t":"say","text":"Orchestrator with workers: scheduled agent fetches and screens feeds, then parallel fan-out translates, maps and drafts memos for approval."}
{"t":"assume","id":"feed-scope","text":"Regulator feeds are public RSS or web pages"}
{"t":"assume","id":"policy-store","text":"Internal policies live in a vector store"}
{"t":"assume","id":"owner-channel","text":"Compliance owner approves via AgentCore chat channel"}
{"t":"ask","id":"volume","text":"How many regulator feed items do you expect per daily run?"}
{"t":"ask","id":"success","text":"What outcome means success, and what is today's manual baseline?"}
