{"t":"say","text":"Parallel fan-out prompt chain: translate six languages, auto-score quality, and escalate low-confidence segments to human translators."}
{"t":"assume","id":"src-lang","text":"Source documentation is in English"}
{"t":"assume","id":"tgt-langs","text":"Target languages: Spanish, French, German, Japanese, Chinese, Arabic"}
