{"t":"say","text":"Parallel fan-out prompt chain translating docs into six languages with automated quality scoring and human escalation for low confidence."}
{"t":"assume","id":"src-lang","text":"Source documentation is in English.","alt":"Source language differs from English."}
{"t":"assume","id":"seg-size","text":"Documents are pre-segmented into paragraphs or sentences.","alt":"Raw documents need chunking first."}
{"t":"ask","id":"volume","text":"How many document segments do you expect to translate per day?"}
{"t":"ask","id":"success","text":"What quality score threshold defines success, and what is today's baseline?"}
{"t":"each","id":"lang-loop","over":"es, fr, de, ja, zh, ko","parallel":true}
{"t":"step","id":"trigger","kind":"trigger","label":"Receive doc segment","runs":"fc"}
{"t":"step","id":"translate","kind":"ai","label":"Translate segment","task":"translate","ai":"qwen3.7-plus","runs":"agentrun","repeat":"lang-loop","why":"Mid-tier model handles translation with high fidelity across six target languages."}
{"t":"step","id":"score","kind":"ai","label":"Score translation quality","task":"check","ai":"qwen3.8-flash","runs":"agentrun","repeat":"lang-loop","after":"translate","why":"Small model efficiently evaluates translation adequacy and fluency."}
{"t":"step","id":"route","kind":"decide","label":"Route by confidence","task":"decide","ai":"qwen3.8-flash","runs":"agentrun","repeat":"lang-loop","after":"score","why":"Exclusive branch separates confident translations from those needing human review."}
{"t":"step","id":"accept","kind":"end","label":"Auto-accepted translation","runs":"customer","repeat":"lang-loop","after":"route","why":"Terminal step for high-confidence outputs."}
{"t":"step","id":"human-review","kind":"human","label":"Human translator review","task":"takeover","runs":"cloudflow","repeat":"lang-loop","after":"route","why":"CloudFlow callback waits for human translator to fix low-confidence segments."}
{"t":"step","id":"final","kind":"end","label":"Final translated segment","runs":"customer","repeat":"lang-loop","after":"human-review","why":"Terminal step after human approval or edit."}
{"t":"link","id":"trig-trans","from":"trigger","to":"translate"}
{"t":"link","id":"trans-score","from":"translate","to":"score"}
{"t":"link","id":"score-route","from":"score","to":"route"}
{"t":"link","id":"route-accept","from":"route","to":"accept","kind":"branch","label":"confidence >= 0.85"}
{"t":"link","id":"route-human","from":"route","to":"human-review","kind":"escalate","label":"confidence < 0.85"}
{"t":"link","id":"human-final","from":"human-review","to":"final"}
{"t":"done","summary":"Translation pipeline fans out across six languages, scores quality automatically, accepts high-confidence output and escalates low-confidence segments to human translators via CloudFlow."}

