{"t":"say","text":"Single agent pattern: CloudMonitor trigger feeds an SRE agent that gathers evidence, reasons, and proposes rollback for approval."}
{"t":"assume","id":"alert-src","text":"CloudMonitor alerts arrive via EventBridge webhook to FC.","alt":"Alerts come from a custom monitoring system or third party."}
{"t":"assume","id":"rollback-sys","text":"Rollback is executed via the customer's CI/CD or deployment API.","alt":"Rollback uses Alibaba Cloud ACK or SAE native rollback APIs."}
{"t":"step","id":"alert-in","kind":"trigger","label":"Receive CloudMonitor alert","product":"eventbridge","runs":"fc","untrusted":true,"effect":"read","why":"Entry point for incoming infrastructure or application alerts"}
{"t":"step","id":"alert-guard","kind":"guard","label":"Validate alert payload","product":"ai-guardrails","runs":"fc","why":"Screen untrusted external alert data before agent processing"}
{"t":"step","id":"sre-agent","kind":"agent","label":"SRE investigation agent","task":"plan","ai":"qwen3.8-max","runs":"agentrun","turns":10,"approval":"skip","why":"Autonomously gather logs, metrics, hypothesize root cause and draft rollback"}
{"t":"step","id":"fetch-logs","kind":"tool","label":"Fetch application logs","tool":"mcp","on":"sre-agent","runs":"customer","effect":"read","private":true,"why":"Retrieve recent error logs for the alerted service"}
{"t":"step","id":"fetch-metrics","kind":"tool","label":"Fetch system metrics","tool":"mcp","on":"sre-agent","runs":"customer","effect":"read","why":"Pull CPU, memory, latency and error rate time series"}
{"t":"step","id":"check-deploy","kind":"tool","label":"Check recent deployments","tool":"mcp","on":"sre-agent","runs":"customer","effect":"read","why":"Identify if a recent release correlates with the alert"}
{"t":"step","id":"approve-rollback","kind":"human","label":"Approve rollback plan","task":"approve","subject":"sre-agent","runs":"cloudflow","approval":"required","why":"On-call engineer must approve the consequential rollback decision"}
{"t":"step","id":"exec-rollback","kind":"act","label":"Execute service rollback","effect":"admin","runs":"customer","approval":"required","why":"Apply the approved rollback via CI/CD or cloud deployment API"}
{"t":"step","id":"rollback-done","kind":"end","label":"Rollback completed","runs":"customer","why":"Terminal state after successful rollback execution"}
{"t":"step","id":"no-action","kind":"end","label":"No rollback needed","runs":"customer","why":"Terminal state when agent finds no rollback necessary or human rejects"}
{"t":"link","id":"l-alert-guard","from":"alert-in","to":"alert-guard"}
{"t":"link","id":"l-guard-agent","from":"alert-guard","to":"sre-agent"}
{"t":"link","id":"l-agent-approve","from":"sre-agent","to":"approve-rollback","kind":"branch","label":"rollback proposed"}
{"t":"link","id":"l-agent-noaction","from":"sre-agent","to":"no-action","kind":"branch","label":"no rollback needed"}
{"t":"link","id":"l-approve-exec","from":"approve-rollback","to":"exec-rollback","kind":"branch","outcome":"approve"}
{"t":"link","id":"l-approve-reject","from":"approve-rollback","to":"no-action","kind":"branch","outcome":"reject"}
{"t":"link","id":"l-approve-edit","from":"approve-rollback","to":"sre-agent","kind":"branch","outcome":"edit"}
{"t":"link","id":"l-exec-done","from":"exec-rollback","to":"rollback-done"}
{"t":"ask","id":"vol-q","text":"How many CloudMonitor alerts do you expect per day?"}
{"t":"ask","id":"success-q","text":"What defines a successful resolution, and what is today's mean-time-to-recovery baseline?"}
{"t":"done","summary":"SRE agent workflow triggered by CloudMonitor via EventBridge, using MCP tools for logs/metrics/deployments, reasoning with qwen3.8-max, and gating rollback through human approval on CloudFlow."}

{"t":"say","text":"Single agent pattern with PDF parsing, planner approval gate, and guarded spend actions for shipment exceptions."}
{"t":"assume","id":"asn-src","text":"ASN data arrives via webhook or polling a supplier API"}
{"t":"assume","id":"pdf-loc","text":"Supplier PDFs are stored in OSS or attached to events"}
{"t":"assume","id":"erp-api","text":"Expedite orders use a customer ERP or logistics API"}
{"t":"ask","id":"volume","text":"How many shipment exception events do you expect per day?"}
{"t":"ask","id":"success","text":"What outcome defines success, and what is today's baseline resolution time?"}
{"t":"step","id":"trigger","kind":"trigger","label":"Shipment exception event","product":"eventbridge","runs":"fc","untrusted":true,"why":"Entry point for delayed shipment or ASN mismatch alerts"}
{"t":"step","id":"guard-in","kind":"guard","label":"Screen inbound event","product":"ai-guardrails","runs":"fc","why":"Validate untrusted webhook payload before agent processing"}
{"t":"step","id":"agent","kind":"agent","label":"Logistics exception agent","task":"plan","ai":"qwen3.8-max","runs":"agentrun","turns":10,"private":true,"why":"Orchestrates PDF reading, calculation, and planner handoff"}
{"t":"step","id":"pdf-tool","kind":"tool","label":"Parse supplier PDF","task":"extract","tool":"pdf_parse","on":"agent","effect":"read","private":true,"why":"Extract text from supplier PDF documents for analysis"}
{"t":"step","id":"calc-tool","kind":"tool","label":"Calculate expedite cost","tool":"code_interpreter","on":"agent","why":"Run math to compare shipping options and costs"}
{"t":"step","id":"erp-tool","kind":"tool","label":"Book expedite order","tool":"mcp","on":"agent","effect":"pay","approval":"required","runs":"customer","why":"Execute spend action in customer ERP after approval"}
{"t":"step","id":"planner","kind":"human","label":"Planner review","task":"approve","subject":"agent","runs":"cloudflow","why":"Human planner must approve any spend commitment"}
{"t":"step","id":"done","kind":"end","label":"Exception resolved","runs":"customer","why":"Terminal state for handled shipment exception"}
{"t":"step","id":"declined","kind":"end","label":"Spend declined","runs":"customer","why":"Terminal state when planner rejects the expedite plan"}
{"t":"link","id":"trig-guard","from":"trigger","to":"guard-in","kind":"next","label":"Event received"}
{"t":"link","id":"guard-agent","from":"guard-in","to":"agent","kind":"next","label":"Clean input"}
{"t":"link","id":"agent-plan","from":"agent","to":"planner","kind":"next","label":"Option ready"}
{"t":"link","id":"plan-yes","from":"planner","to":"agent","kind":"branch","outcome":"approve","label":"Approved to spend"}
{"t":"link","id":"plan-no","from":"planner","to":"declined","kind":"branch","outcome":"reject","label":"Rejected"}
{"t":"link","id":"plan-edit","from":"planner","to":"agent","kind":"branch","outcome":"edit","label":"Revise options"}
{"t":"link","id":"agent-end","from":"agent","to":"done","kind":"next","label":"Action complete"}
{"t":"done","summary":"Agent workflow that parses supplier PDFs, calculates expedite options, gates spend behind planner approval, and books via ERP tool."}

{"t":"say","text":"Prompt chain pattern: guarded email triage, knowledge retrieval, drafting, human approval and Direct Mail delivery."}
{"t":"step","id":"in","kind":"trigger","label":"Email webhook","product":"eventbridge","runs":"fc","untrusted":true,"why":"Inbound support email arrives via EventBridge webhook from customer mailbox"}
